From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 00:35:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: t8010: Let the Wi-Fi firmware follow the
 country

Apple's Broadcom firmware starts in the NVRAM's worldwide locale (XZ),
and in it refuses joins on most 5 GHz channels at once, with nothing
sent: brcmfmac reports status 16 within about 100 ms. brcmfmac passes
the regulatory country (from an access point's country element, or
user space) to the firmware only when the node says how to translate
it. Use the trivial map, as the iPad 5 already does: Apple's CLM takes
the ISO 3166 code with revision 0.

On a J71b among access points that announce ID, joins on 5 GHz failed
until a firmware reload while channel 6 worked; with the firmware's
country set to ID, reconnects on channel 153 succeeded every time.
This covers the iPad 6 and 7 (J71b, J72b, J171, J172) and the iPhone 7 (D11, D111).

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8010-d11.dts    | 1 +
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8010-d111.dts   | 1 +
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8010-ipad6.dtsi | 1 +
 3 files changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8010-d11.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8010-d11.dts
index 355a50c3aa10..f8185fd33418 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8010-d11.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8010-d11.dts
@@ -57,6 +57,7 @@ wifi0: wifi@0,0 {
 			vdd-supply = <&wlan_vdd>;
 			apple,antenna-sku = "XX";
 			brcm,board-type = "apple,sven";
+			brcm,ccode-map-trivial;
 		};
 	};
 };
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8010-d111.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8010-d111.dts
index d81f40c9afa3..05e3f230b146 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8010-d111.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8010-d111.dts
@@ -57,6 +57,7 @@ wifi0: wifi@0,0 {
 			vdd-supply = <&wlan_vdd>;
 			apple,antenna-sku = "XX";
 			brcm,board-type = "apple,olaf";
+			brcm,ccode-map-trivial;
 		};
 	};
 };
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8010-ipad6.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8010-ipad6.dtsi
index d2b8bdce4f9f..cd4e184e797d 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8010-ipad6.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8010-ipad6.dtsi
@@ -246,6 +246,7 @@ wifi: wifi@0,0 {
 			apple,wlan-uart = <&wlan_uart2>;
 			device-wake-gpios = <&pinctrl_ap 23 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;
 			vdd-supply = <&wlan_vdd>;
+			brcm,ccode-map-trivial;
 		};
 	};
 };
